<title>DUBAI: Oman oil throughput 71,995 bpd in H1 '96 - agency. [CORRECTED 12:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Oman oil throughput 71,995 bpd in H1 '96 - agency. [CORRECTED 12:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's oil throughput reached approximately 71,995 barrels per day (bpd) in the first half of 1996, down from 77,604 bpd in the year-ago period, the official Oman News Agency reported on Friday.</p>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to make clear figures refer to throughput and not output).</p>
<p>-- Dubai newsroom +9714-6071-222</p>
